# Allowed characters per file (nix T24). Last match wins. Same sets as
# congestimancer.

# The floor: plain ASCII everywhere.
* ascii

# Markdown that documents notation may hold it.
*.md ascii+spec

# Prose a reader meets first stays plain.
README.md ascii
docs/**/*.md ascii
AGENTS.md ascii+caveman

# Specs and the vendored spec format are written in caveman notation.
SPEC.md ascii+spec
**/SPEC.md ascii+spec
FORMAT.md ascii+spec
FORMAT-EXTENSIONS.md ascii+spec

# Token ceilings cite spec sections by the section sign.
.context-limits ascii+caveman

# pklith-generated steps may cite spec sections.
hk.pklith.pkl ascii+caveman

# Vendored hk schema, not ours to rewrite.
pkl/Config.pkl any
